<title>USA: ACX Technologies sees Q4 charge.</title>
<headline>ACX Technologies sees Q4 charge.</headline>
<dateline>GOLDEN, Colo. 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACX Technologies Inc said it plans to restructure the operations of its subsidiary, Golden Technologies Co Inc.</p>
<p>The restructuring is expected to result in a pretax, fourth quarter charge of between $15 million and $25 million and includes an assessment of all assets and activities within GTC, the company said.</p>
</text>
